---
import Base from "$layouts/Base.astro";
import music from "../data/qq-music.json";
const synced = new Intl.DateTimeFormat("zh-CN", {timeZone:"Asia/Shanghai",dateStyle:"medium",timeStyle:"short"}).format(new Date(music.syncedAt));
---
<Base title="Listening · 在听" description="determine 的 QQ 音乐歌单与喜欢的歌曲。">
<main class="listening">
<header><p class="eyebrow">LISTENING / 在听</p><h1>音乐，和生活一起。</h1><p>把喜欢的旋律留在这里，愿与你共鸣。</p><a href={music.profileUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{music.owner} · QQ 音乐主页 ↗</a></header>
<section aria-labelledby="report-title"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="report-title">听歌手记</h2><span>PC 端统计</span></div><div class="report-lead"><strong>{music.report.monthlySongs.toLocaleString()}</strong><span>本月已听 · 首</span></div><dl class="report-grid"><div><dt>今日听歌</dt><dd>{music.report.todayMinutes}<small> 分钟</small></dd></div><div><dt>本周日均</dt><dd>{music.report.weeklyDailyMinutes}<small> 分钟</small></dd></div><div><dt>本月连续听歌</dt><dd>{music.report.monthlyStreakDays}<small> 天</small></dd></div><div><dt>本月最爱时段</dt><dd>{music.report.favoriteHour}</dd></div></dl><p class="artist">月度艺人 <strong>{music.report.topArtist}</strong> · 本月播放 {music.report.topArtistMinutes} 分钟 · TOP.1</p><p class="report-note">你于 {music.report.providedOn} 提供的统计快照；仅 PC 数据，QQ 音乐说明每天 18 点更新。此报表尚未接入自动同步。</p></section>
<section aria-labelledby="playlist-title"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="playlist-title">我的歌单</h2><span>{music.playlists.length} 份</span></div><ul class="playlists">{music.playlists.map(p=><li><a href={`https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq_v2/playlist/${p.id}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>{p.title}</strong><span>{p.count.toLocaleString()} 首 ↗</span></a></li>)}</ul></section>
<section aria-labelledby="songs-title"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="songs-title">喜欢的歌曲</h2><span>展示 {music.songs.length} / {music.likedTotal} 首</span></div><ol class="songs">{music.songs.map((song,i)=><li><span class="number">{String(i+1).padStart(2,"0")}</span><div><h3>{song.title}</h3><p>{song.artist}</p></div><a href={`https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq_v2/songDetail/${song.mid}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label={`在 QQ 音乐收听 ${song.title}`}>QQ 音乐 ↗</a></li>)}</ol></section>
<aside><p>最近同步：<time datetime={music.syncedAt}>{synced}</time>（北京时间）</p><p>来自 QQ 音乐账号页面的可见列表，保留原顺序；“喜欢”不等于“最近播放”。当前网页版只展示前 10 首，完整内容请在 QQ 音乐查看。</p><p>本机浏览器定时同步，依赖电脑与登录状态；这是最近一次读取的快照，不是实时播放状态。播放、登录及版权权限由 QQ 音乐提供。</p></aside>
</main>
</Base>
<style>
.report-lead{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1rem;margin:1.5rem 0}.report-lead strong{font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:500}.report-lead span,.report-note,.artist{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--secondary-color);line-height:1.8}.report-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.5rem;margin:0 0 1.5rem}.report-grid dt{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--secondary-color)}.report-grid dd{font-size:1.2rem;margin:.4rem 0 0}.report-grid small{font-size:.75rem}.artist strong{color:var(--primary-color)}.listening{max-width:740px;width:100%;margin:2rem auto 0;padding:0 1rem;box-sizing:border-box}.eyebrow,.number,.section-heading span{font-family:monospace;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--secondary-color)}.eyebrow{letter-spacing:.15em}header{margin-bottom:3rem}h1{font-size:1.9rem;margin:.6rem 0 1rem}header>p:not(.eyebrow){color:var(--secondary-color);line-height:1.8}a{text-underline-offset:4px}header>a{font-size:.8rem;text-decoration:underline}section{margin:0 0 2.5rem}.section-heading{display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid var(--block-color);padding-bottom:.8rem}h2{font-size:1rem;margin:0}.playlists,.songs{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.playlists{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 1.5rem}.playlists li{border-bottom:1px solid var(--block-color)}.playlists a{display:flex;gap:.7rem;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem 0}.playlists strong{font-size:.85rem;font-weight:500}.playlists span{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--secondary-color);white-space:nowrap}.songs li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2rem minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:.8rem;align-items:center;padding:1.2rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--block-color)}h3{font-size:.95rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.5;margin:0}.songs p{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--secondary-color);margin:.3rem 0 0}.songs a{font-size:.75rem;white-space:nowrap}aside{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--secondary-color);line-height:1.9}a:hover{text-decoration:underline}@media(max-width:480px){.playlists{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:1.6rem}.songs li{grid-template-columns:1.5rem minmax(0,1fr);gap:.5rem}.songs a{grid-column:2}.listening{margin-top:1rem}}
</style>
